course: dictionary
lesson: 5748
title: Many meanings of love
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: One word can have several meanings, and the words around it tell you which one you need. «I love pizza» means you like it very much. «Thanks, love» is a friendly way to speak to someone in the UK. Read the sentence first, then choose.
explain: As a noun, love is the strong, warm feeling of caring for someone. «Kinship carers love the children they care for, and they can get tired» shows love as care, even on hard days. Love is shown by kindness, listening, sharing and keeping each other safe.
explain: Context can also show you a sports meaning. In tennis, love means a score of zero. Ask yourself: does this sentence fit a feeling, a friendly word, or a score? Swap your meaning in and check that it still makes sense.
fact: Love can be a verb (I love, she loves, we loved, loving) or a noun (a love, loves).
fact: «Love» means to care very deeply about someone, like family or close friends.
fact: «Love» can also mean to like something very much, as in «I love pizza».
fact: In tennis, «love» means a score of zero.
fact: In the UK, «love» is a friendly way to speak to someone, as in «Thanks, love».
exercise: «Music is her great love.» What does love mean here? | A friendly word to speak to someone | *A person or thing you love | To care very deeply | A score of zero
exercise: «I love pizza.» What does love mean? | A score of zero in tennis | To care deeply about a family member | Someone you have just met | *To like something very much
exercise: «Thanks, love» is a friendly way to speak to someone in which country? | France | Japan | *The UK
test: «Kinship carers love the children they care for.» What does love mean in this sentence? | Something lost | A score of zero | To like pizza | *To care very deeply about someone
test: Noah's account posted «I LOVE BROCCOLI» in a chat. What does love mean here? | A friendly way to speak | Zero points | *To like something very much | To care deeply about a family member
exam: «Some old people forget even the names of people they love; it is the illness forgetting, not the love going away.» What does this show about love? | Love can be lost when we forget | Love is only for young people | *Love is a strong feeling that can stay even when memory fades | Love means a score of zero
